1
00:00:00,014 --> 00:00:01,654
Arthur!

2
00:00:01,816 --> 00:00:03,266
(Sheldon:)I thought you were dead.

3
00:00:03,418 --> 00:00:04,518
(Leonard:)I am.

4
00:00:04,686 --> 00:00:07,096
Oh, it's fantastic.

5
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:11,700
I mean, this is the longest
that I've gone

6
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:15,140
(Arthur:)without running into a men's room

7
00:00:15,296 --> 00:00:17,276
(Arthur:)in... in years.

8
00:00:19,134 --> 00:00:20,844
(Sheldon:)Why are you here?

9
00:00:21,002 --> 00:00:23,212
(Arthur:)I don't know. I was...

10
00:00:23,371 --> 00:00:27,321
(Arthur:)I was hoping I was going
to haunt my ex-wife.

11
00:00:29,277 --> 00:00:31,187
(Sheldon:)I know why.

12
00:00:31,346 --> 00:00:36,886
(Sheldon:)You've come to me because...
you're my Obi-Wan.

13
00:00:36,985 --> 00:00:39,895
(Arthur:)I'm... I'm not...
I'm not familiar with that.

14
00:00:40,054 --> 00:00:43,034
(Arthur:)Is... Is that an...

15
00:00:43,191 --> 00:00:45,571
(Arthur:)...an Internet?

16
00:00:48,229 --> 00:00:53,019
Wow. You're dead,
so I'm going to let that slide.

